+3. Migrate your existing Charges API integration on [Web](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-intents/migration.md#web), [iOS](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=ios), and [Android](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=android) to use the Payment Intents API.
